# macOS (ld64) counterpart to luvie.version — see the comment there for why the plugin's
# symbol table has to be restricted at all. -exported_symbols_list is absolute: anything
# not named here is made local, including symbols pulled in from the static archives, so
# no --exclude-libs equivalent is needed.
#
# Mach-O symbol names carry a leading underscore, which the C names below do not have in
# the version script. Each module exports only the one it defines; an unmatched name in
# this list produces a warning at most, not an error.
_lv2_descriptor
_lv2ui_descriptor
